{"title":"Career roadmap · Operations Executive","role":"Operations Executive","summary":"An Operations Executive manages and improves the day-to-day activities that keep an organisation running efficiently. The role can involve process coordination, vendors, inventory, customer operations, documentation, reporting, logistics, service delivery, workforce coordination and performance monitoring.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA General"},"about":[{"label":"Core combination","text":"Management + analytics + process improvement + execution"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA General provides a strong and direct foundation because it covers management, finance, marketing, HR, operations and business analytics."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA General","Operations Internship","Operations Executive / Management Trainee","Senior Operations Executive","Operations Manager","Senior Operations Manager","Head of Operations / COO"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build management, operations, Excel, analytics, communication and project-management skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Become a specialist in business, supply-chain, service, project or process operations"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Operations Manager, Business Operations Lead, Program Manager or General Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into Head of Operations, Business Unit leadership, COO or operations consulting"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Management fundamentals"},{"tex